      "description": "Representative selected and unselected destinations from the reserved bottom dock.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-dock\" aria-label=\"Example navigation\"><button class=\"ds-nav\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m3 9 9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z\"/><path d=\"M9 22V12h6v10\"/></svg><span>Overview</span></button><button class=\"ds-nav\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"3\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 21h8m-4-4v4\"/></svg><span>System Info</span></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-dock{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 16px;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#303943);background:var(--surface,#090c10)}.ds-nav{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong,#657586);border-radius:3px;background:transparent;padding:8px 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;transition:background-color 150ms,border-color 150ms,color 150ms;min-width:94px;min-height:64px;border:0;border-radius:0;padding:8px;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;color:var(--muted,#a0adb9);font-size:12px}.ds-nav[aria-current=\"page\"]{color:var(--text,#f1f4f6);background:var(--surface-hover,#111923);box-shadow:inset 0 -2px var(--blue,#4a9aff)}.ds-nav:hover{background:var(--surface-hover,#111923)}.ds-nav:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue,#4a9aff);outline-offset:4px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-dock,.ds-nav{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Completed State Label",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "state-completed",
      "description": "Text-only status label; the established component has no capsule fill.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-state\">Completed</span>",
      "css": ".ds-state{font-size:12px;color:var(--green,#85d9bd);white-space:nowrap;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Settings Container",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "settings-container",
      "description": "A ruled section from the appearance workbench, with a compact heading and explanatory text.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-settings\"><div><h2 class=\"ds-settings-title\">Appearance</h2><p class=\"ds-settings-copy\">Choose the appearance for this local profile.</p></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-settings{display:grid;gap:16px;padding:32px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#303943);color:var(--text,#f1f4f6);font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;}.ds-settings-title{font-family:var(--heading,Bahnschrift),\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.25;margin:0 0 12px}.ds-settings-copy{font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted,#a0adb9);margin:8px 0 16px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Resource Gauge",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "resource-gauge",
      "description": "Illustrative CPU reading demonstrating the actual gauge; unavailable readings omit the fill and percentage.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-gauge\" aria-label=\"Illustrative CPU reading: 38 percent\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 180 180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle class=\"ds-gauge-track\" cx=\"90\" cy=\"90\" r=\"80\"/><circle class=\"ds-gauge-fill\" cx=\"90\" cy=\"90\" r=\"80\" pathLength=\"100\" stroke-dasharray=\"38 100\" transform=\"rotate(-90 90 90)\"/></svg><div class=\"ds-gauge-value\"><span>CPU</span><strong>38<small>%</small></strong><p>Illustrative reading</p></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-gauge{width:min(100%,190px);aspect-ratio:1;position:relative;margin-inline:auto;color:var(--text,#f1f4f6);font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;}.ds-gauge svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;fill:none;stroke-width:5}.ds-gauge-track{stroke:var(--line,#303943)}.ds-gauge-fill{stroke:var(--accent,#4a9aff)}.ds-gauge-value{position:absolute;inset:23% 10% 19%;display:flex;align-items:center;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;text-align:center}.ds-gauge-value>span{color:var(--muted,#a0adb9);font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}.ds-gauge-value strong{font-family:var(--heading,Bahnschrift),\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,42px);line-height:1.3;margin:6px 0}.ds-gauge-value small{color:var(--muted,#a0adb9);font-size:14px;margin-left:3px}.ds-gauge-value p{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted,#a0adb9);margin:0}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Resource Bar",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "resource-bar",
      "description": "Illustrative System Info bar; an unavailable reading retains its track with no fill.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-bar\"><div class=\"ds-bar-heading\"><span>Memory</span><strong>62%</strong></div><div class=\"ds-bar-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i style=\"width:62%\"></i></div><small>Illustrative reading</small></div>",
      "css": ".ds-bar{color:var(--text,#f1f4f6);font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;}.ds-bar-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.ds-bar strong{font-family:var(--measurement,Consolas),monospace;font-weight:400;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-bar small{color:var(--muted,#a0adb9);font-size:12px}.ds-bar-track{height:4px;margin-block:12px;background:var(--line,#303943)}.ds-bar-track i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--accent,#4a9aff)}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Flight Deck",
    "overview": "Flight Deck is a quiet instrument panel for the state of a Windows PC. True black, clear blue telemetry, restrained headings, and compact operational detail make the system feel precise and immediately readable. The computer remains the primary subject; controls and connected services support it.\n\nThe same typography and rectangular structure carry into text-first conversations, approvals, memories, and settings. Depth is restrained, status is explicit, and motion serves interaction. The system accommodates light mode and saved custom accents without changing the visual grammar.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "PC state before assistant content.",
      "Blue instruments and readable tabular measurements.",
      "Rectangular surfaces with hairline structure.",
      "Text-first task workspaces with clear actions and availability.",
      "Reserved header, scrolling content, and bottom navigation."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Readable Accent Rule",
        "body": "Preserve the user's saved accent; derive a readable variant for text and focus. Black accents become white in dark mode. Semantic statuses never inherit the arbitrary accent.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Reserved Shell Rule",
        "body": "Put navigation in its own shell row and let only the content region scroll.",
        "section": "layout"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do keep PC instruments readable before adding supporting service detail.",
      "Do consume semantic CSS properties so light mode and saved accents remain consistent.",
      "Do preserve clear selected, focus, pending, stale, failure, and unavailable states.",
      "Do use rules and spacing to organize text-first task views.",
      "Do reserve viewport space for the header and bottom dock."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't replace the default true-black canvas with a gradient or ornamental backdrop.",
      "Don't turn every section into a rounded floating card.",
      "Don't use color alone to convey status or imply a healthy value from missing data.",
      "Don't animate gauges continuously or add decorative motion loops.",
      "Don't overwrite saved accents or use custom accents for warning and error meaning."
    ]
  }
}
